# EvoSim raw simulation output (~208 MB) stays out of git. Tracked are only
# the small files that pin each run: run_manifest.json (seed) and
# config_snapshot.json per run, plus ablation_rich's experiment manifest,
# spec snapshot and per-scenario configs. Regenerate with
# project_45/code/run_simulations.sh, which needs the course's EvoSim copy
# in data_pprojects/data_tools/evosim_source/ (pyproject 1.0.0, not tracked).
# Kept last so it overrides the generic data/raw/ rule above.
!/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/
/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/*/*
!/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/*/run_manifest.json
!/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/*/config_snapshot.json
!/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/ablation_rich/experiment_*.json
!/data_pprojects/project_45/data/raw/ablation_rich/configs/
